--- !u!114 &523787409
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 523787407}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c68ee4d7dceb346ba4f60d3f40e2cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcID: Daisy_1
  npcName: Daisy
  dialogueLines:
  - "I missed you, Daisy. Moving here has been a hassle, especially since I couldn't
    talk to you!\r"
  - "Oh dear me, it's not your fault. In fact, I should apologize for not contacting
    you. You see, I was kinda stuck. Some might even say\u2026 \u201CPlanted\u201D
    in place! \r"
  - "Heh\u2026\u2026\u2026\r\r"
  - Well, now that we're reunited, HOW ABOUT YOU SHOW ME AROUND YOUR NEW PLACE?
  - CLICK ON THE ARROW AT THE BOTTOM OF THE SCREEN TO GO BACK TO THE LIVING ROOM.
  - "GOOD JOB! NOW IF YOU WANT TO INTERACT WITH AN OBJECT, CLICK ON IT JUST LIKE
    BEFORE. \r\n"
  - Oh nice to meet you.
  - Do you know the other people on this floor?
  - 'Of course I do! Why did you ask?

'
  - 'Well I am doing a house warming party so I was wondering if you could help me
    by having some guests come over?

'
  - That sounds great! I will let everyone know to come.
  - Thanks.
  speakerNames:
  - Toot
  - Player
  - Toot
  - Player
  - Toot
  - Toot
  - Player
  - Player
  - Toot
  - Player
  - Toot
  - Player
  hasChoices: 0
  choiceLineIndex: 2
  yesJumpToLine: 3
  yesEndLine: 4
  noJumpToLine: 5
  noEndLine: 6
  removeAfterDialogue: 1
